      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER IDEA (1) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a two-run winning streak, but could only manage second (30.19) at this track. Rates highly and will give a great sight. BENTLEY KRISTOFF (5) goes very well here starting seven times for four wins and two minors. Was out of placings last time (30.93) at Q Lakeside in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 7 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. GRAMERCY GARRY (8) scored (25.39) last time out at Q Lakeside adding to an already respectable career. Has a good record at this journey. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. SUNSET DREAM (2) will be hard to beat with a drop in journey.",
